GitHub Security Lab advisory GHSL-2021-1058_GHSL-2021-1060: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in mermaid.js (January 12, 2022)
Coordinated Disclosure Timeline
2021-12-28: Maintainers contacted
2021-12-28: Maintainers acknowledged the issues
