GitHub Security Lab advisory GHSL-2023-055: XML external entity (XXE) or server-side request forgery (SSRF) in SAML SSO Jenkins Plugin - CVE-2023-32991, CVE-2023-32992 (May 25, 2023)
Coordinated Disclosure Timeline
