You can contact the GHSL team at securitylab@github.com , please include a reference to GHSL-2024-034 in any communication regarding this issue.

GitHub Security Lab advisory GHSL-2024-035_GHSL-2024-036: CORS misconfguration and Reflected XSS in Casdoor - CVE-2024-41657, CVE-2024-41658 (August 14, 2024)
Coordinated Disclosure Timeline
